Ported code
-----------

web/assets/js/semantic-map.js, entity-graph.js and entity-graph-ui.js are
adapted from DREVisualizations (Africa Multiple Cluster of Excellence,
University of Bayreuth; GPL-3.0-or-later): asset/js/semantic-map.js,
asset/js/entity-graph.js, asset/js/entity-graph-ui.js. web/assets/js/rv-shim.js
re-implements the subset of its dashboard-core.js helpers they call
(ns.graphStep is copied from asset/js/core/graph-walk.js). The embedding
contract in rais/embeddings.py follows its tools/embeddings/build_embeddings.py
and docs/SEMANTIC_EMBEDDINGS.md; the EP3 parsing in rais/ep3.py follows
MongoDB2OmekaS clients/publications/ep3.py.

